1 NAME Carl /Mossin/
2 GIVN Carl
2 _MARNM Mossin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 AUG 1815
2 ADDR
3 STAE Capital Region of Denmark
3 CTRY Denmark
