2 CONT
2 CONT ===MARRIAGE===
2 CONT 7 Mar 1731, Fladstrand, Hjørring, Danmark Anders Davison Wiborg og Metter Marie Borellie
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.sa.dk/ao-soegesider/billedviser?epid=17122640#161829,27187445
