1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Utvandret til USA, var selger og forretningsmann i Kalispild eller Somers i Montana. (Slekten Ellingsen.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Martin B. Normann was born at Rokenos, Harstad, Norway, August 24, 1867. In 1917 Mr. Normann came to the Flathead and settled at Somers where he was employed in the Flathead Commercial Co. A few years later he became associated wi
2 CONC th the Normann-Smith & Co. of Somers and operated that store until poor health forced his retirement in 1933. In 1935 he moved to Kalispell and made his home here since that time at 144 Woodland Avenue where he died February 12, 1
2 CONC 951 at the age of 83.Surviving him are his wife, Nellie Johns Normann at their home on Woodland Avenue; two sons, Theodore of Seattle and Homer Normann of Somers; three grandchildren and one sister Christine Normann, living in Nor
2 CONC way.
2 CONT  (Tekst fra: Find A Grave Memorial # 17367551 Daily Inter Lake February 16, 1951)
