1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The clue in finding his Norwegian identity is given in the 1900 census, where it says he was born November 1838. In the 1880 Census and other places he has the initial "H" as his second name. Then we were able to f
2 CONC ind Haagen Haftorsen born 29th November 1838 in Stjørdal. They lived on the farm Borseth. In his confirmation in 1853 then the family lived on the farm Skjelstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the 1900 census he immigrated in 1865. He is not found in the Norwegian census of 1865.
2 CONT
